{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10086","headline":"抱疾谢李吏部赠诃黎勒叶 · 包佶","name":"抱疾谢李吏部赠诃黎勒叶","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一叶生西徼，齎来上海查。\n岁时经水府，根本别天涯。\n方士真难见，商胡辄自夸。\n此香同异域，看色胜仙家。\n茗饮暂调气，梧丸喜伐邪。\n幸蒙祛老疾，深愿驻韶华。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"包佶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10086.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10086","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}